flowchart TB
  accTitle: Inside /tk:document
  accDescr: Document follows review once the review loop has settled. It updates the README, CLAUDE.md, the changelog, the lessons and the design profile; the codebase map is left for merge to offer once the work lands. It looks for the places you corrected Claude and keeps them in a private correction ledger on your machine, saving nothing until you accept it. It commits, writes the cycle page saying what changed and why, and in a worktree pushes the branch and opens a pull request, or, where branches land on your machine, saves its text for merge. The line ends here.

